<h1>Prorated Salary Calculator</h1>
<p>Calculate the exact gross pay owed for a partial pay period. Whether someone starts mid-month, leaves before month end, or takes unpaid leave, this prorated salary calculator handles it in seconds using either the working days method or the calendar days method.</p>

